## 4. Curated Plugin Matrix (Folia-Supported)

Because Folia runs parallelized region tick loops, all plugins must target Folia's `RegionScheduler` and `GlobalRegionScheduler`.

| Category | Plugin Name | Gameplay Feature |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Land Claims** | `HuskClaims` / `CrashClaim` | Grief prevention, region-aware sub-division claims, and party permissions. |
| **Economy** | `Vault-Unlocked` + `AxAuctions` | Multi-node player auctions, chest shops, and transactional trade. |
| **RPG & Skills** | `AuraSkills` | RPG stats (Strength, Agility, Mining), mana systems, and dynamic ability triggers. |
| **Custom Content** | `ItemsAdder` (Folia build) | 3D weapon models, custom ores, and HUD elements via auto-sent resource packs. |
| **Portals & Teleport** | `HuskHomes` + `HuskPortals` | Thread-safe cross-dimension / cross-server teleportation (`/tpa`, `/home`). |
| **Voice Chat** | `SimpleVoiceChat` | 3D directional proximity voice with dynamic group channels. |
| **Diagnostics** | `Spark` (Folia build) | Live profiling of individual region tick rates, memory leaks, and CPU load. |
| **Web Map** | `BlueMap` | Interactive asynchronous 3D map rendering in the browser. |

